39-jin:m143-0051","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p143","quote":"重耳"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m016-0241","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p016","quote":"晉公子重耳"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m017-0032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p017","quote":"重耳"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m030-0089","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p030","quote":"晉文"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0319","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","quote":"晉文"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0399","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","quote":"文公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m040-0504","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p040","quote":"文公"}],"identity_note":"依本卷特定時代與敘事建立；同名與世襲官號不得全庫合併，本名未見不補造。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p051","quote":"晉文公重耳，晉獻公之子也。自少好士，年十七，有賢士五人：曰趙衰；狐偃咎犯，文公舅也；賈佗；先軫；魏武子。自獻公爲太子時，重耳固已成人矣。獻公卽位，重耳年二十一。獻公十三年，以驪姬故，重耳備蒲城守秦。獻公二十一年，獻公殺太子申生，驪姬讒之，恐，不辭獻公而守蒲城。獻公二十二年，獻公使宦者履鞮趣殺重耳。重耳踰垣，宦者逐斬其衣袪。重耳遂奔狄。狄，其母國也。是時重耳年四十三。從此五士，其餘不名者數十人，至狄。","source_term":"晉獻公之子"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji039-038","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000252"]},{"id":"8ov_spc_ch8","label":"重耳母女弟（夷吾母）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"女弟","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m026-0151"]},{"surface":"母","mention_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin:m026-0146"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m026-0151","chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p026","quote":"女弟"},{"mention_id":"c-